{"4564280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Labyrinth of Trials", "steam_appid": 4564280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Labyrinth of Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dangerous labyrinth filled with traps, enemies, and constant threats. Every level is a challenge where survival depends on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, avoid deadly traps, and face enemies when necessary. Your goal is to reach the end of each level alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to navigate the labyrinth, survive encounters, and use strategy to overcome increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is risky. Weapons help you fight, but they have limited durability. Once they break, you are left vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields protect you from enemy attacks, but they can also be destroyed. Managing both weapons and shields is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect upgrades to restore durability and keep going. Enemies will hunt you, so choose carefully when to fight and when to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, plan your moves, and survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous enemies with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and shield durability system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management and survival mechanics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Labyrinth of Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dangerous labyrinth filled with traps, enemies, and constant threats. Every level is a challenge where survival depends on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, avoid deadly traps, and face enemies when necessary. Your goal is to reach the end of each level alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to navigate the labyrinth, survive encounters, and use strategy to overcome increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is risky. Weapons help you fight, but they have limited durability. Once they break, you are left vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields protect you from enemy attacks, but they can also be destroyed. Managing both weapons and shields is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect upgrades to restore durability and keep going. Enemies will hunt you, so choose carefully when to fight and when to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, plan your moves, and survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous enemies with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and shield durability system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management and survival mechanics</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Every level is a challenge where survival depends on your decisions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564280/79ecec8f6e149253f2309c29faf7f4bb73f30167/header.jpg?t=1776098268", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564280/b10d597e82e4a0c73306b8c5dee8c7b642311460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776098268", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564280/b10d597e82e4a0c73306b8c5dee8c7b642311460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776098268", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 210<br>